There's no need to use all your wishes right away; it's not as if they
will time out or anything. You can get what you want/need right now and
save the rest. Heck, people have ascended with handfuls of potential
wishes in their inventory.

> I know I must spend one wish on something to recharge the wand
> with, so I thought a magic marker rather than scrolls of
> charging.

There's no 'must' about it; if you already have a scroll of charging, or
you know how to write it and have a magic marker and a scroll of blank
paper (one of which blessed, the other non-cursed) you're all set and
there's no need to use a wish for that.

