You're likely to find a lot of stuff in the Valley of the Death. If I were
you I'd wait to see if there was something I really needed; at the moment
it looks as if you're well-equipped to descend into Gehennom. You might
want to have free action, but the chests and boxes in the Valley hold
lots of goodies; experience teaches that if you wish for something in the
Castle on the general principle that it's nice to have, you'll find it
there.

